1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,164
Kashi ki Dev Deepawali, hazaaron saal purani ya sirf 1985 se?

2
00:00:06,164 --> 00:00:10,087
Lakhon diye, ghaton par aag ki nadi.

3
00:00:10,087 --> 00:00:14,570
Lekin is raushni ki asli umar kya hai?

4
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:19,027
Aap sochte honge, yeh parampara hazaaron saal purani hai.

5
00:00:19,027 --> 00:00:22,988
Ki devta khud utarte hain, Ganga mein nahane.

6
00:00:22,988 --> 00:00:27,940
Magar records kuch aur kehte hain. Sunkar aap chaunk jaayenge.

7
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:33,130
Local records kehte hain, saare ghat ek saath 1985 mein saje.

8
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:37,847
Shuruaat Panchganga Ghat se hui. Yaani sirf kuch dashak pehle.

9
00:00:37,847 --> 00:00:41,150
To phir yeh katha kahaan se aayi?

10
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:46,089
Kyunki is raat ke peeche bahut puraani kahani hai.

11
00:00:46,089 --> 00:00:52,125
3 udte hue shehar, aasmaan mein. Aur Shiv ka woh teer,

12
00:00:52,125 --> 00:00:54,320
jisne sab jala diya.

13
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:56,082
To sawaal yeh hai.

14
00:00:56,082 --> 00:01:01,807
Kya Kashi ki yeh raat sach mein Tripur ke jalne ki yaad hai?

15
00:01:01,807 --> 00:01:04,890
Ya Kashi ne apni nayi parampara banayi?

16
00:01:04,890 --> 00:01:09,983
Pehle granth ki gawahi. Phir mitti ke neeche mile sikke.

17
00:01:09,983 --> 00:01:14,058
Phir woh records, jo kahani badal dete hain.

18
00:01:14,058 --> 00:01:19,660
Aur har sabut ke saath saaf bataayenge, granth hai ya khudai.

19
00:01:19,660 --> 00:01:24,635
Aur haan, Tripuri naam ka ek shehar sach mein tha.

20
00:01:24,635 --> 00:01:27,123
Madhya Pradesh ki mitti mein.

21
00:01:27,123 --> 00:01:30,605
Uske sikkon par yahi naam likha mila.

22
00:01:30,605 --> 00:01:33,590
Lekin kya yeh wahi Tripur hai?

23
00:01:33,590 --> 00:01:37,199
Par asli sawaal ab shuru hota hai.

24
00:01:37,199 --> 00:01:41,324
Is katha ki sabse purani gawahi kahaan hai?

25
00:01:41,324 --> 00:01:46,480
Jawab Mahabharat se bhi pehle, seedha Vedon tak jaata hai.

26
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:49,368
Krishna Yajurveda ki Taittiriya Samhita.

27
00:01:49,368 --> 00:01:55,720
Yeh is katha ki sabse purani likhit gawahi maani jaati hai.

28
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:59,763
Samhita yaani Vedon ke mantron ka sangrah,

29
00:01:59,763 --> 00:02:02,650
peedhiyon se yaad kiya hua.

30
00:02:02,650 --> 00:02:07,027
Wahan likha hai, asuron ke 3 kile the.

31
00:02:07,027 --> 00:02:13,045
Sabse neeche lohe ka. Uske upar chaandi ka. Aur sabse upar,

32
00:02:13,045 --> 00:02:15,780
chamakta hua sone ka kila.

33
00:02:15,780 --> 00:02:19,213
Devta unhe jeet nahi paa rahe the.

34
00:02:19,213 --> 00:02:24,606
Phir Rudra ne teer chhoda. Rudra, yaani Shiv ka Vedic naam.

35
00:02:24,606 --> 00:02:29,510
Teer ne kilon ko cheer diya, asur bhaga diye gaye.

36
00:02:29,510 --> 00:02:34,286
Lekin Vedon mein yeh katha chhoti hai. Kuch hi panktiyan.

37
00:02:34,286 --> 00:02:39,062
Asli bada drishya milta hai Mahabharat ke Karna Parva mein.

38
00:02:39,062 --> 00:02:43,360
Wahan yeh kahani ek poori film ban jaati hai.

39
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:46,878
Karna Parva yaani Mahabharat ka woh hissa,

40
00:02:46,878 --> 00:02:50,396
jahan Karn senapati bante hain. Wahin Duryodhan,

41
00:02:50,396 --> 00:02:54,920
Shalya ko yeh purani katha sunata hai. Taaki Shalya,

42
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:56,930
Karn ka saarthi bane.

43
00:02:56,930 --> 00:03:03,264
Katha mein 3 asur bhai hain. Tarakaksha, Kamalaksha aur Vidyunmali.

44
00:03:03,264 --> 00:03:07,065
Unke paas udte hue shehar hain.

45
00:03:07,065 --> 00:03:12,133
Jo din raat aasmaan mein ghoomte rehte hain,

46
00:03:12,133 --> 00:03:15,300
koi unhe chhoo nahi paata.

47
00:03:15,300 --> 00:03:20,084
Shart yeh thi, shehar sirf tab gir sakte the.

48
00:03:20,084 --> 00:03:24,337
Jab woh aasmaan mein seedh mein aa jaayein.

49
00:03:24,337 --> 00:03:28,590
Aur woh pal bahut, bahut kam aata tha.

50
00:03:28,590 --> 00:03:32,704
Shiv ke liye ek anokha rath banaya gaya.

51
00:03:32,704 --> 00:03:37,332
Kehte hain poora brahmand hi us rath mein tha.

52
00:03:37,332 --> 00:03:41,960
Shiv bane Tripurantak, yaani Tripur ka ant karne wale.

53
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:45,177
Jaise hi Shiv dhanush lekar khade hue,

54
00:03:45,177 --> 00:03:49,774
shehar seedh mein aa gaye. Usi pal 1 teer chala.

55
00:03:49,774 --> 00:03:54,370
Aur dekhte hi dekhte, sab kuch aag mein badal gaya.

56
00:03:54,370 --> 00:03:58,775
Lekin is katha ka Kashi ki raat se kya rishta hai?

57
00:03:58,775 --> 00:04:01,978
Granth mein kahin Dev Deepawali likha hai kya?

58
00:04:01,978 --> 00:04:03,980
Yahan pehla twist aata hai.

59
00:04:03,980 --> 00:04:08,719
Skanda Purana mein Kartik maheene ki poonam khaas hai.

60
00:04:08,719 --> 00:04:12,931
Purana yaani purani kathaon aur niyamon ki kitaab.

61
00:04:12,931 --> 00:04:17,670
Ise Tripuri Purnima kehte hain, yaani Tripur wali poonam.

62
00:04:17,670 --> 00:04:22,774
Is din ke khaas kaam bataye gaye hain. Kartik snan,

63
00:04:22,774 --> 00:04:26,347
yaani nadi mein pavitra snan. Aur deepdan,

64
00:04:26,347 --> 00:04:29,920
yaani diya jalakar bhagwan ko arpit karna.

65
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:34,691
Dhyan dijiye, yahan baat har bhakt ke apne diye ki hai.

66
00:04:34,691 --> 00:04:38,161
Ek saath poore shehar ko sajaane wala utsav?

67
00:04:38,161 --> 00:04:40,330
Woh bilkul alag sawaal hai.

68
00:04:40,330 --> 00:04:46,675
Ek aur purani parampara hai, Akashdeep. Bamboo ke lambe danday par,

69
00:04:46,675 --> 00:04:53,020
tokri ke andar diya. Poore Kartik maheene, oonchaai par jalta hua.

70
00:04:53,020 --> 00:04:57,529
Skanda Purana ke Kartik Mahatmya mein iska zikr hai.

71
00:04:57,529 --> 00:05:01,538
Mahatmya yaani kisi cheez ki mahima ka varnan.

72
00:05:01,538 --> 00:05:04,544
Yeh diya Vishnu ko prasann karne,

73
00:05:04,544 --> 00:05:07,550
aur purvajon ki shanti ke liye.

74
00:05:07,550 --> 00:05:11,970
Yaani Kashi mein diye ka rishta bahut purana hai.

75
00:05:11,970 --> 00:05:16,391
Lekin woh diya akela tha, ghar ki chhat par,

76
00:05:16,391 --> 00:05:20,320
ya ghat ke kinare. Bheed wala utsav nahi.

77
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:23,870
Phir aati hai Kashi ki sabse pyaari maanyata.

78
00:05:23,870 --> 00:05:28,308
Kartik Purnima ko 33 crore devta dharti par utarte hain.

79
00:05:28,308 --> 00:05:30,970
Sirf Ganga mein nahane ke liye.

80
00:05:30,970 --> 00:05:35,867
Woh Shiv ki Tripurasur par jeet ka jashn manaate hain.

81
00:05:35,867 --> 00:05:40,274
Isliye naam pada, Dev Deepawali, yaani devtaon ki Diwali.

82
00:05:40,274 --> 00:05:45,660
Yeh Kashi ka lok-vishwas hai, jo peedhi dar peedhi sunaaya gaya.

83
00:05:45,660 --> 00:05:49,566
To katha Vedon mein hai, rasm Purana mein hai.

84
00:05:49,566 --> 00:05:53,906
Lekin kya Tripur naam ka koi asli shehar bhi tha?

85
00:05:53,906 --> 00:05:56,510
Iska jawab ek khudai mein mila.

86
00:05:56,510 --> 00:06:01,271
Madhya Pradesh mein Jabalpur ke paas ek gaon hai, Tewar.

87
00:06:01,271 --> 00:06:04,127
Naam mein kuch khaas nahi lagta.

88
00:06:04,127 --> 00:06:07,460
Lekin iske paas ki zameen ke neeche,

89
00:06:07,460 --> 00:06:09,840
ek purana shehar soya hai.

90
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:13,546
ASI yaani Archaeological Survey of India.

91
00:06:13,546 --> 00:06:18,487
Desh ki purani dharohar sambhalne wali sarkari sanstha.

92
00:06:18,487 --> 00:06:23,429
Uski khudai ne bataya, yahi prachin Tripuri hai.

93
00:06:23,429 --> 00:06:28,370
Khudai yaani zameen ko dheere khodkar itihaas nikaalna.

94
00:06:28,370 --> 00:06:31,756
Yeh basti kab ki hai? ASI ke mutabik,

95
00:06:31,756 --> 00:06:36,411
iski jadein bahut purani hain. Tamra-Pashan yug ke aakhri daur tak.

96
00:06:36,411 --> 00:06:40,220
Yaani jab insaan tamba aur pathar saath chalata tha.

97
00:06:40,220 --> 00:06:43,884
Aur phir mile sikke. Tambe ke sikke.

98
00:06:43,884 --> 00:06:49,642
Un par shehar ka naam likha tha, Tirpuri. Prakrit bhasha mein,

99
00:06:49,642 --> 00:06:53,830
Brahmi lipi mein. Yahi sabse bada sabut hai.

100
00:06:53,830 --> 00:06:59,296
Brahmi yaani Bharat ki sabse purani lipiyon mein se ek.

101
00:06:59,296 --> 00:07:03,668
Prakrit yaani us zamane ki bolchaal ki bhasha.

102
00:07:03,668 --> 00:07:09,680
Aur sikkon ki umar? 2nd century BCE, ya usse bhi pehle.

103
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:13,806
Sochiye, Mahabharat jis Tripur ki baat karta hai.

104
00:07:13,806 --> 00:07:18,964
Aur zameen se nikle sikke, jin par Tirpuri likha hai.

105
00:07:18,964 --> 00:07:23,090
Kya yeh wahi Tripur hai? Yahin savdhaani chahiye.

106
00:07:23,090 --> 00:07:27,833
Sikke sirf itna batate hain ki Tripuri naam ka shehar tha.

107
00:07:27,833 --> 00:07:30,851
Wahan log rehte the, len-den karte the.

108
00:07:30,851 --> 00:07:34,300
Udte kilon ka koi sabut mitti nahi deti.

109
00:07:34,300 --> 00:07:38,759
ASI ne Tewar mein phir khudai shuru ki, 2021 mein.

110
00:07:38,759 --> 00:07:42,326
Is baar zameen se aur bhi cheezein nikleen.

111
00:07:42,326 --> 00:07:47,230
Aur yeh cheezein ek bade shehar ki taraf ishaara karti hain.

112
00:07:47,230 --> 00:07:52,325
Balua pathar ke khambhe mile. Balua pathar yaani sandstone,

113
00:07:52,325 --> 00:07:56,853
wahi laal-bhoora pathar. Saath mein eenton ki deewar,

114
00:07:56,853 --> 00:08:03,080
aur purane zamane ka saamaan. Sab dheere-dheere bahar aa raha hai.

115
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:07,532
ASI kehta hai, yahan log lambe samay tak base.

116
00:08:07,532 --> 00:08:12,973
Yeh ek sangathit shehar tha. Lekin kaam abhi poora nahi hua.

117
00:08:12,973 --> 00:08:16,930
Khambhe abhi tak poori tarah khule bhi nahi.

118
00:08:16,930 --> 00:08:19,452
To Tripuri ek asli shehar tha.

119
00:08:19,452 --> 00:08:21,974
Lekin Dev Deepawali Tripuri mein nahi,

120
00:08:21,974 --> 00:08:24,917
Kashi ke Ganga ghaton par hoti hai.

121
00:08:24,917 --> 00:08:28,700
Aur un ghaton ki umar? Yahan agla twist hai.

122
00:08:28,700 --> 00:08:34,738
Varanasi ke ghat, yaani nadi tak utarti pathar ki seedhiyan.

123
00:08:34,738 --> 00:08:40,171
Ginti mein 84 ghat. Aap tasveer dekhkar sochte hain,

124
00:08:40,171 --> 00:08:43,190
yeh hazaaron saal purane honge.

125
00:08:43,190 --> 00:08:48,519
Lekin ASI aur UNESCO ki tentative suchi kuch aur kehti hai.

126
00:08:48,519 --> 00:08:51,911
Zyaadatar ghat 1700 ke baad dobara bane.

127
00:08:51,911 --> 00:08:57,240
Matlab aaj jo pathar aap chhoote hain, woh utna purana nahi.

128
00:08:57,240 --> 00:09:02,217
Us samay Kashi Maratha samrajya ke prabhav mein thi.

129
00:09:02,217 --> 00:09:08,299
Ghaton ko banwane wale the Marathe, Scindia, Holkar, Bhonsle aur Peshwe.

130
00:09:08,299 --> 00:09:12,170
Inhone nadi kinare pathar ki seedhiyan bichhwaayi.

131
00:09:12,170 --> 00:09:15,092
Iska matlab yeh nahi ki Kashi nayi hai.

132
00:09:15,092 --> 00:09:18,013
Ganga kinare puja bahut purani ho sakti hai.

133
00:09:18,013 --> 00:09:21,300
Bas aaj ki pathar ki seedhiyan, baad ki hain.

134
00:09:21,300 --> 00:09:26,369
Granth ke hisaab se Kartik ka maheena khaas hai.

135
00:09:26,369 --> 00:09:30,875
Log subah nahate, tokriyon mein Akashdeep oonche latakte.

136
00:09:30,875 --> 00:09:37,070
Lekin aaj jaisa diyon ka samandar? Uski kahani bilkul alag hai.

137
00:09:37,070 --> 00:09:41,720
Ab sochiye. Granth mein deepdan hai. Akashdeep ki parampara hai.

138
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:44,045
Ghat baad mein pakke bane.

139
00:09:44,045 --> 00:09:49,160
To sab ghaton par ek saath diye pehli baar kab jale?

140
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:53,594
Aur woh kahani shuru hoti hai Panchganga Ghat se.

141
00:09:53,594 --> 00:09:57,536
Ek tareekh ke saath, jo bahut nayi hai.

142
00:09:57,536 --> 00:10:01,970
Par records khud bhi ek baat par nahi tikte.

143
00:10:01,970 --> 00:10:07,564
Local records ke mutabik, saamuhik Dev Deepawali 1985 mein shuru hui.

144
00:10:07,564 --> 00:10:12,649
Saamuhik yaani poore ghat ke log, ek saath milkar manaayein.

145
00:10:12,649 --> 00:10:15,700
Har ghar ka alag diya nahi.

146
00:10:15,700 --> 00:10:20,513
Jagah thi Panchganga Ghat, Kashi ke purane ghaton mein se ek.

147
00:10:20,513 --> 00:10:24,014
Wahan logon ne milkar seedhiyon par diye sajaaye.

148
00:10:24,014 --> 00:10:28,390
Aur dekhte hi dekhte, baat poore shehar mein phail gayi.

149
00:10:28,390 --> 00:10:33,091
Phir 1991 mein utsav Dashashwamedh Ghat tak phaila.

150
00:10:33,091 --> 00:10:36,616
Wahan ise aur bada roop mila.

151
00:10:36,616 --> 00:10:43,080
Dheere-dheere baaki ghat bhi jud gaye. Yahi hai aaj ka chehra.

152
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:48,757
Lekin yahan records mein farq hai. Ek source kehta hai,

153
00:10:48,757 --> 00:10:52,731
shuruaat 1991 mein hui. Dashashwamedh Ghat par,

154
00:10:52,731 --> 00:10:55,570
ek sthaniya pandit ne ki.

155
00:10:55,570 --> 00:11:00,269
Unhe log Babu Maharaj ke naam se jaante the,

156
00:11:00,269 --> 00:11:03,401
Pandit Kishori Raman Dubey. Doosri taraf,

157
00:11:03,401 --> 00:11:08,100
kuch records 1985 aur Panchganga ka naam lete hain.

158
00:11:08,100 --> 00:11:13,164
To shuruaat kahan aur kab hui, is par raay alag hai.

159
00:11:13,164 --> 00:11:16,386
Lekin ek baat par sab sahmat hain.

160
00:11:16,386 --> 00:11:20,990
Yeh saamuhik roop kuch dashak purana hai, hazaaron saal nahi.

161
00:11:20,990 --> 00:11:24,643
Matlab pehle sawaal ka aadha jawab mil gaya.

162
00:11:24,643 --> 00:11:27,840
Shiv ki katha prachin granthon mein hai.

163
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:30,580
Snan aur deepdan bhi prachin hain.

164
00:11:30,580 --> 00:11:33,320
Saare ghaton ki raushni nayi hai.

165
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:36,993
Kya isse parampara chhoti ho jaati hai? Bilkul nahi.

166
00:11:36,993 --> 00:11:40,257
Kashi ne purani katha ko naya roop diya.

167
00:11:40,257 --> 00:11:43,930
Har parampara kabhi na kabhi nayi hi hoti hai.

168
00:11:43,930 --> 00:11:47,013
Lekin ab sabse gehra sawaal bachta hai.

169
00:11:47,013 --> 00:11:50,096
Shehar aasmaan mein seedh mein kaise aaye?

170
00:11:50,096 --> 00:11:54,500
Kya kisi ne sach mein aasmaan mein kuch dekha tha?

171
00:11:54,500 --> 00:12:00,240
Mahabharat ki shart yaad kijiye. Shehar sirf tab jal sakte the,

172
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:05,979
jab woh seedh mein aayein. Aur aisa bahut kam hota tha.

173
00:12:05,979 --> 00:12:09,110
Yahi baat scholars ko kheenchti hai.

174
00:12:09,110 --> 00:12:14,643
Kuch vidwan kehte hain, yeh grahon ki yuti ho sakti hai.

175
00:12:14,643 --> 00:12:18,165
Yuti yaani jab aasmaan mein grah paas-paas,

176
00:12:18,165 --> 00:12:20,680
ek seedh mein dikhte hain.

177
00:12:20,680 --> 00:12:27,753
Archaeoastronomy yaani purane granthon aur imaaraton mein aasmaan ki jaankari dhoondhne ka vigyan.

178
00:12:27,753 --> 00:12:32,106
Isi se jude kuch log yahi poochhte hain.

179
00:12:32,106 --> 00:12:35,370
Kya purvajon ne kuch dekha tha?

180
00:12:35,370 --> 00:12:38,980
Kuch aur log alag andaaza lagaate hain.

181
00:12:38,980 --> 00:12:42,591
Shayad koi ulka girti dekhi gayi ho.

182
00:12:42,591 --> 00:12:46,201
Ulka yaani aasmaan se girta jalta pathar,

183
00:12:46,201 --> 00:12:48,780
jise shooting star kehte hain.

184
00:12:48,780 --> 00:12:54,064
Magar dharm aur granthon ke kai vidwan bilkul alag sochte hain.

185
00:12:54,064 --> 00:12:57,427
Unke liye yeh katha ek rupak hai.

186
00:12:57,427 --> 00:13:01,270
Rupak yaani kahani ke zariye gehri seekh dena.

187
00:13:01,270 --> 00:13:05,810
Unke hisaab se yeh Vedic yagya ki bhasha hai.

188
00:13:05,810 --> 00:13:10,349
Ya brahmand ke ant aur naye aarambh ka prateek.

189
00:13:10,349 --> 00:13:13,880
Yaani aasmaan ki nahi, mann ki kahani.

190
00:13:13,880 --> 00:13:18,817
Kaun sahi hai? Abhi tak koi tay nahi kar paaya.

191
00:13:18,817 --> 00:13:21,779
Aasmaan wala andaaza saabit nahi hua.

192
00:13:21,779 --> 00:13:27,210
Aur rupak wali baat bhi bas padhne ka ek tareeka hai.

193
00:13:27,210 --> 00:13:29,554
To abhi kya nahi pata?

194
00:13:29,554 --> 00:13:35,179
Hum nahi jaante ki 3 udte shehron ki katha kahaan se janmi.

195
00:13:35,179 --> 00:13:38,460
Aasmaan dekhkar, ya yagya ki bhasha se.

196
00:13:38,460 --> 00:13:43,639
Tewar ki Tripuri aur is katha ka rishta bhi saaf nahi.

197
00:13:43,639 --> 00:13:46,934
Naam milta hai, par sabut adhoora hai.

198
00:13:46,934 --> 00:13:50,230
Aur wahan khudai abhi poori nahi hui.

199
00:13:50,230 --> 00:13:56,048
Aur Dev Deepawali ki pehli shaam kahaan jali, Panchganga ya Dashashwamedh?

200
00:13:56,048 --> 00:13:59,222
Records ek awaaz mein nahi bolte.

201
00:13:59,222 --> 00:14:05,040
Shayad Kashi ke buzurg aaj bhi woh raat yaad karte hon.

202
00:14:05,040 --> 00:14:09,828
Lekin jo pata hai, woh aap khud dekh sakte hain.

203
00:14:09,828 --> 00:14:13,658
Seedha apni aankhon se. Chaliye, Kashi chalte hain.

204
00:14:13,658 --> 00:14:17,010
Aur phir Tewar ki mitti tak bhi.

205
00:14:17,010 --> 00:14:22,048
Kartik Purnima ki shaam, Kashi ke ghaton par khade hoiye.

206
00:14:22,048 --> 00:14:26,582
Pathar ki seedhiyan, jo Marathon ke zamane mein bichhi.

207
00:14:26,582 --> 00:14:31,620
Unpar jalte diye, jo pichhle kuch dashkon ki den hain.

208
00:14:31,620 --> 00:14:35,625
Ganga mein subah ka Kartik snan dekhiye.

209
00:14:35,625 --> 00:14:40,201
Aur oonche bamboo par tokri wale Akashdeep dhoondhiye.

210
00:14:40,201 --> 00:14:45,350
Yeh woh hissa hai, jo granthon mein likha hai.

211
00:14:45,350 --> 00:14:50,368
Aur agar itihaas ki mitti chhoni ho, to Tewar jaaiye.

212
00:14:50,368 --> 00:14:55,887
Tewar gaon se lagbhag 2 km door, prachin Tripuri ki jagah.

213
00:14:55,887 --> 00:14:59,400
Jahan ASI ne khambhe aur deewarein nikaali.

214
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:03,502
To wapas pehle sawaal par. Shiv ne Tripur jalaya,

215
00:15:03,502 --> 00:15:08,515
yeh granthon ki katha hai. Aur Kashi ne us katha par,

216
00:15:08,515 --> 00:15:11,250
diyon ki ek nayi parampara banayi.

217
00:15:11,250 --> 00:15:14,868
Agle video mein chalenge Pushkar,

218
00:15:14,868 --> 00:15:22,105
jahan Kartik Purnima par mela lagta hai. Lekin pehle bataiye.

219
00:15:22,105 --> 00:15:30,066
Aapne Dev Deepawali Kashi mein dekhi hai, ya sirf tasveeron mein?
